Notes on bundled / consumed data:

- Card data: Magic: The Gathering card metadata (names, oracle text, type
  lines, color identity, etc.) sourced from Scryfall is licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0). See
  `docs/LICENSE_AUDIT.md` for attribution details. Magic: The Gathering and
  its associated trademarks are property of Wizards of the Coast LLC. This
  project is unaffiliated.
- Card images cached locally under `data/card_images/` derive from Scryfall's
  bulk image endpoints. Same CC-BY 4.0 attribution applies.
- Bundled dependency licenses: see `docs/LICENSE_AUDIT.md` for the top-level
  npm + pip dependency audit. All top-level dependencies as of v1.0 are
  permissively licensed (MIT / BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0).
